1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:08,090
Mara! How much did they pay you? Don't walk off. They're paying for an answer.

2
00:00:14,600 --> 00:00:18,280
Move it. I have to clock in.

3
00:00:18,630 --> 00:00:22,320
Then say you didn't take the money.

4
00:00:28,600 --> 00:00:36,090
Nora Chen. If you've got letters, bills, anything you want me to see, call me.

5
00:00:36,440 --> 00:00:39,170
I've got plenty of those.

6
00:00:44,000 --> 00:00:49,530
If I tell you what happened, are they going to leave us alone?

7
00:00:52,000 --> 00:00:53,700
I can't promise that.

8
00:00:57,000 --> 00:01:01,680
They know what I did. They keep making up the rest.

9
00:01:07,000 --> 00:01:12,110
Then tell me your part. We can stop if you need to.

10
00:01:15,000 --> 00:01:16,280
Is it on?

11
00:01:17,000 --> 00:01:18,200
No.

12
00:01:20,000 --> 00:01:21,280
All right. Ask.

13
00:01:28,000 --> 00:01:30,550
Did you know about the reward?

14
00:01:33,000 --> 00:01:35,980
Yes. He said please and thank you.

15
00:01:39,000 --> 00:01:41,130
I'm asking about the money.

16
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:51,530
I saw the amount. I thought about Friday's deposit. That's in there too.

17
00:01:54,000 --> 00:01:59,110
Kids were right there. I didn't know if he had a gun.

18
00:02:05,000 --> 00:02:10,530
UnionCare turned down her renewal. I needed the extra shift to cover it.

19
00:02:14,000 --> 00:02:18,260
You can show them that part. Not all my bills.

20
00:02:20,000 --> 00:02:21,200
This page?

21
00:02:27,000 --> 00:02:32,110
The denial. And the shift I asked for. Leave the rest here.

22
00:02:45,600 --> 00:02:52,620
Can I have the green one? Don't show them the bridge. It's not ready.

23
00:02:52,970 --> 00:02:56,180
Ellie, no one's taking your map.

24
00:03:14,000 --> 00:03:16,550
I can cut her voice out.

25
00:03:21,000 --> 00:03:26,960
No, leave it. Maybe if they hear her, they'll get why I was there.

26
00:03:34,000 --> 00:03:36,550
Do you have what you need?

27
00:03:39,000 --> 00:03:42,830
For this part, yes. I'll send you the link.

28
00:03:58,000 --> 00:04:04,060
Stay in there. I'll get your pencils. Don't open the front door.

29
00:04:07,600 --> 00:04:17,470
Mara, it's the clinic. That was me on the other line. We found the submission record. Call the main desk.
